<title>UK: Safeway prices 150 mln stg seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Safeway prices 150 mln stg seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager Credit Suisse First Boston, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SAFEWAY PLC</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     7.50	MATURITY    11.MAR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.37     PAY DATE    11.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.375     REOFFER    99.37     SPREAD	+45 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  1.75	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.75 PCT NOV 2004 GILT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
